<h2>What is Studio Hero — Study — 3D Studio™?</h2>
<p>Woodex 3D Studio™ is the professional visualization division of Woodex Interior — producing photorealistic 3D renders, architectural animations, walkthrough videos, 360° virtual tours and shadow studies for interior design, architecture, real estate and commercial projects across Pakistan — The studio operates as an integrated part of Woodex Interior's design and build service — and as a fully independent visualization studio available to architects, developers and design firms who commission rendering work directly — Study labelled Study — rooms drawn so they can be built — real photography TBD per Phase 1 gap analysis — Wellstar DHA Lahore confirmed — Pharmacy, Cosmetics and Mini Hospital — proof.</p>

<h2>A Still is a Meeting — Stills First — One Still Per Key Room</h2>
<p>3D is not a marketing afterthought — It is how a family or a board approves materials, light and furniture before construction — A still is a decision — A walkthrough is a sequence — VR is for when you need to stand in the room — We model from the same drawings the mill will read — Stills first — One still per key room — Walkthrough / 360 only if the sequence matters — One revision cycle — The still is the contract — DRAWN. THEN BUILT. — See the room before it exists — No fake sqft rate — plan holds number.</p>
